--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -8,6 +8,22 @@ package, not for somebody reading this repository's commit log.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Fixed
+
+- Preserve the failing field path in tool rejection messages with legacy validator error shapes.
+
+- Load the schema validator through its CommonJS default export so registry construction works in ESM applications without requiring a named export.
+
+### Changed
+
+- Tool calls that fail their declared input schema now return a validation result to the model
+  before the executor runs. Executors that previously produced their own errors for malformed
+  input no longer receive those calls; valid input, including extra properties, remains unchanged.
+
+- Registering a static tool now compiles its JSON Schema and rejects invalid schemas immediately,
+  with an error naming the tool. Fix invalid schemas before registering tools. Schema compilation
+  uses the new runtime dependency `ajv`.
+
 ## [0.3.0] - 2026-09-17
 
 ### Changed
